⚡️🇺🇸 Al Udeid Air Base in Qatar is completely devoid of U.S. aircraft, nothing is seem for photographs, no helicopters and no transport planes, if there is anything there, it is likely under concrete shelters.

However, considering that even a hardened shelter was struck in Jordan and allegedly the F-15 under it was destroyed, this soon might not even be the case.

